으로 패킷 오버헤드가 적다. 예를 들어, TCP와 UDP의 체크","words":[{"text":"체크섬","x":228,"y":2439,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"방법은","x":341,"y":2439,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"상대적으로","x":458,"y":2439,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"패킷","x":645,"y":2440,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"오버헤드가","x":722,"y":2439,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"적다.","x":900,"y":2439,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":985,"y":2439,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"들어,","x":1061,"y":2438,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"TCP와","x":1147,"y":2438,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"UDP의","x":1262,"y":2439,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"체크","x":1384,"y":2439,"width":66,"height":37}]},{"text":"심은 16비트만 사용한다. 그러나 다음에 설명할 링크 계층에서 주로 시용되는 CRC와","words":[{"text":"심은","x":167,"y":2502,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"16비트만","x":245,"y":2502,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"사용한다.","x":397,"y":2502,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":560,"y":2502,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"다음에","x":676,"y":2502,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"설명할","x":788,"y":2501,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":900,"y":2501,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"계층에서","x":976,"y":2499,"width":124,"height":39},{"text":"주로","x":1117,"y":2501,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":1196,"y":2500,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"CRC와","x":1340,"y":2501,"width":111,"height":37}]},{"text":"비교하면 오류 면에서 상대적으로 취약하다. 그렇다면 왜 트랜스포트 계층에서는 체크","words":[{"text":"비교하면","x":169,"y":2564,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"오류","x":309,"y":2565,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"면에서","x":392,"y":2564,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"상대적으로","x":508,"y":2563,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"취약하다.","x":693,"y":2563,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"그렇다면","x":845,"y":2561,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"왜","x":986,"y":2560,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1029,"y":2560,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"계층에서는","x":1208,"y":2561,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"체크","x":1385,"y":2562,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"411","words":[{"text":"411","x":1733,"y":138,"width":68,"height":34}]}]}